{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t天文台發出特別天氣提示，受強烈東北季候風影響，預料本港今晚氣溫將進一步下降，明早最低氣溫在16度左右。星期三早上新界仍然清涼，日夜溫差頗大。<br/>\n<br/>\n天文台呼籲市民留意天氣變化，注意保暖，並關顧長者及慢性病患者。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：黃佩珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.406395+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T03:59:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T11:16:41.002277+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:39.104645+00:00","content_hash":"df5f3b2c9345035ec9ea3552fefeec50eca609c372afa10cd16916f53a558dad","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}